Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about falling for the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you should\Nreally be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you about the fire damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe try listening next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why you\Nare getting so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:00:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a normal back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have this horrible feeling that\NI'll die if someone sees my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was gonna die! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My curiosity got the best of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was attacked by a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn thing must have been\Nattached to his back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which explains why Heaven's Door couldn't\Nreveal it when he arrived at the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was already too late by that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stand attached itself\Nto him before he got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The architect isn't a user, he's a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was used like a meat\Npuppet to get to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.66,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piggyback, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the enemy's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's play piggyback, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:01:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piggyback, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.98,0:02:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we play piggyback, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breakdown, breakdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, breakdown, breakdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, breakdown, breakdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breakdown, breakdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
