Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.40,0:03:40.65,Main,SPW,0,0,0,,{\an8}These all come from after Kira disappeared, so there aren't many.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hence the small number.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're of the mind that\Nsome of those people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could be Kira's victims\Nmakes a lot of sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a possibility, but we can't\Nknow that for sure at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to follow his\Nevery conceivable move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how\Ninsignificant the activity seems
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any action he takes can\Nhave far-reaching effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They always do
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.09,0:04:03.55,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,420)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 12:55 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piggyback, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piggyback, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Door! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piggyback, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, piggyback, please. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damn thing has\Nattached itself to my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this because of the architect?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I looked at his back? Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignite the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please ignite the\Npictures you've collected?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignite the what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get rid of those pesky pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pictures I took Could one of\Nthem lead us to Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're attempting a cover-up. Just\Nset all the pictures on fire. Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll do it, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you leech!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:04:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I read your powers\Nthat inscribe my mandate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am known as Cheap Trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I was given life when my\NSazokinoto was impaled by the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since he died, my\Nuser is Kishibe Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've relocated to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my user now whether\Nyou want to be or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you attack me with a stand, all\Nyou're doing is hurting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scary, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a stand with a will of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, Masazo Kinoto birthed me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he didn't have the wherewithal\Nto control me as a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I filled his mind with lots\Nof horrifying whispers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the terror of his bony back being\Nseen consumed him at the very end,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get it, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I whisper fear into the ears of my host.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you know my\Npower, burn those pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dirty leech, get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll get you off my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, all\Nyou have to do is show me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just show someone your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll leave you and\Nattach to another soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just takes a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afternoon, Rohan-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an avid reader of your work, though\Nyou might want to try some nudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nude women, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's burn those photos, yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.58,0:06:37.04,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,392)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 12:47 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shiosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he caught the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining diamond, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess the rumors were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can indeed handle a bullet at\Npoint-blank range without an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is freaky, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:07:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now chomp down on that lip, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's almost there. Bite it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me that bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me your mark of fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sheet of paper must be a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be, since it's as pathetic\Nas that geezer in the photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still won't bite, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems he's trying to cover\Nup his fear with anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I suppose\Nit's time for the big reveal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cocky bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about this doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been hiding this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he choose to show himself now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made himself appear\Nso you'd attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of there, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you were right a moment ago\Nwhen you said I had a pathetic stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not all bad, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its ability allows me to\Ntransform almost anything into
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a piece of paper to be filed\Ndiscreetly and conveniently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this slip of paper contains\NKoichi Hirose. Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've had Koichi this entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up Koichi's scent again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't holding on to\None of his belongings!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the user of a pathetic\Nthird-rate stand ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have the\Npower or ability to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if someone were to tear it into\Nlittle pieces, that's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna let you off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.22,0:08:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring Koichi back now, and I'll\Nonly beat you down to a bloody pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.96,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: Hirose Koichi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.74,0:08:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my stand isn't the most powerful and\Nit doesn't have the ability to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it were to be ripped to shreds...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't go after that\Npaper if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shosuke, ignore it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, at long last!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mysterioso was waiting for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata, the moment you\Nbit your lip, you sealed your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You devious dickhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just revealed your mark of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can attempt to resist all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are now powerless before Mysterioso.
