Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Josuke, but I'm glad\Nwe made that agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had tried to help, he\Nwould have gotten me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.44,0:10:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one with the\Nscent discerning abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've fallen prey to its power,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you understand why Mysterioso's\Nthe most unstoppable force ever seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand is repairing the metal pole,\Nand he's using the energy to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The piece of paper you're holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I looked inside, I'm\Nguessing I wouldn't find Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew from the start that was just a dirty\Ndecoy with Koichi Hirose written on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason you had the\Nconfidence to reveal your true self
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to me was because you still had\Nthe real Koichi held hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping him alive is the only way\Nfor you to maintain your leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that piece of paper was\Njust a trap to lure me into danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.86,0:10:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so, I still had no other choice\Nbut to go after that stupid scrap of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite it being a trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there was still a chance you'd thrown\Nthe real Koichi toward that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it comes to my friends,\NI don't care if it's a 1 % chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Losing them is a risk that\NI'm just not willing to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mysterioso can have the win for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sucks, but there's not much more\NShining Diamond can do at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me give you a piece of advice before\NI become one of your paper prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rip me to oblivion the\Nmoment I finish folding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause if I'm able to make it\Nout of this bullshit trap alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll freaking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty loud bark you had there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad you didn't\Nhave the bite to match.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.31,0:11:48.56,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: Hirose Koichi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya Fungami, allow me to commend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:12:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not assisting Josuke was a very wise move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have easily disposed\Nof you had you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mark of fear is a stroke of the chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you're doing it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the old man in the photo\Nnever ordered me to kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I suppose your death has been\Npostponed for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smart move, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to hear something interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This paper it's tough but\Nanyone can release its contents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By unfolding it straightforward?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but for someone consumed with fear\Nit's surprisingly becoming difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mariah Grand Hotel, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.09,0:12:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keicho Hirose and Josuke\NHigashikata have been disposed of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe should be enjoying\Nthe same fate about now!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.63,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,463)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 2:21 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one exposes Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which picture is that\Nold man so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just burn them all, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.09,0:13:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There just aren't enough clues\Nfor me to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's burn them, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, you pest! Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to let them know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone needs to know what's going on!
