Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.95,0:13:31.87,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,515)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 1:20 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, that was Mariah Grand Hotel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you spending the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure, though I do have a\Nlot of work to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of work, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I cannot allow you\Nto reach that hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Josuke, you're\Nsuch a pompous asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing you get captured makes\Nme think about my darling girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm saying this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if any one of my loving,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supportive vixens was ever turned\Ninto a piece of paper, I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to think about it,\Nbut if they were nabbed by this creep...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do the same thing to get them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I let you or Kira get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never be able to look at\Nmyself in the mirror again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I order you to release Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I rescind my earlier statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a most unwise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm not sure you really\Nwant to take me on, coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doing so would instantly make\Nyou an enemy of Kira's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,63, 64, and 65.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a tank, but Highway\NKick is a relentless hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you're\Ngetting away, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not at the hotel yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't look like\Nanybody's in the taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still picking up\Nhis scent from the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could he have run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.14,0:15:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, the scent of this paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This paper smells like Koichi and Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Highway Kick, don't\Nopen the door just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastard thinks I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is clearly another trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's attempting to lure me in, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'd fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.96,0:15:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants me to be afraid, that's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the question is, how's he gonna do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this piece of\Npaper stuck in the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.90,0:15:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's underestimating me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But based on this scent, I'm\Nsure the paper is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I figured out what kind it is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm opening the door, Highway Kick.
