Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy can turn fire into paper, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen through your little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, Koichi, I'm gonna\Nget you out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unless my nose is lying to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's something else lurking\Nin there besides those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm gonna have to go\Nabout this very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like that other\Nsmell is moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's faint, but I think\Nit's coming from...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highway Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I think it's some kind of chemical.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.13,0:16:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing after another.\NWait a sec. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm getting a nose full of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, he wants me to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I allow him to freak\Nme out, he wins. Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? A machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to open the damn paper!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.92,0:17:08.00,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: Higashikata Josuke, Hirose Koichi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shosuke! Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell can it stand\Nhide electricity and paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if this predicament wasn't bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm smelling that horrible\Nmechanical stench again, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Shredder!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't turn off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bullying in Josuke and Koichi! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highway Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highway Star is too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not capable of stopping this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:17:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you finally gave in, Yuya Fungami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The onset of fear, followed\Nby a touch to the chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though fear just isn't your look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scaring the ever-loving shit out\Nof you was surprisingly simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya Fungami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mysterioso can turn absolutely\Nanyone into a piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone, anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes your stance so amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It instantly transforms\Nits target into paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit it, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really got me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I couldn't be happier to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, if I wasn't\Na flimsy piece of paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to\Nreach inside this shredder!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.96,0:18:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just pull out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not unfold that sheet of paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd turn into paper any day\Nto see that look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya Fungami. Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I gotta say, you're a\Ncooler dude than I took you for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay the hell away\Nfrom me or else I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take this paper and I'll rip it to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you really sacrifice Yuya like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Act three! Three! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to remember\Nwhat I said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm forgetting something,\Nbut I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, it's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I said I'd kill you\Nwhen I got out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that is definitely what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I also said something about\Nnever forgiving someone as vile as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who takes hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:20:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who uses psychological\Nblackmail to screw with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just take a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I wanted to do was observe people's\Nreaction to fear stimuli, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just acquired my stand a bit\Nago, so I guess I got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like an absolute heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've actually noticed something about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get scared, I'm pretty sure\None of your eyes squints involuntarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say it's a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, when you're really losing your\Nshit, you close both your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you like observing people, huh?\NThen please knock yourself out, but
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're gonna keep your mouth shut
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and behave yourself understand the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:21:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,young mysterioso Terunosuke miyamoto\Nhuman book and out of commission
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,josuke never bothered reading it\Nbut instead donated it to the Mariah
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Library.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mention Mysterioso to any librarian and\Nthey'll let you read it, but borrowing it is
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be surprised if you hear a\Nfaint voice while perusing its pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's taken
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why do I feel like\NI've spoken too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, this means we've gotten
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one step closer to\Ncapturing Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but we still\Ndon't have a single clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.24,0:21:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're resilient little crotch crawlers!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.94,0:21:40.61,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,558)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 4:10 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.56,0:21:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling your friends for\Nhelp isn't going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.40,0:21:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have some photos to burn now. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.38,0:21:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.03,0:21:54.20,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,677)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 4:30 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:21:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm heading out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.90,0:21:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:21:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To go and find our leads\Nas soon as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll investigate where each\Nmissing person was last seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can escape from their\Ninnate personality for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll make his move soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.93,0:22:15.64,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,428)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 4:52 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find proof that he's not my real dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will!
